{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1693.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"9031ed15a1b4d272d7281a0ea0b855aaca641dc6b1eae6234968503de22cda41","ja":"小学生の憧れの年越し","zh":"小学生向往的跨年","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1693.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"20f093fe7ad52438798b7c735001d4d13e3947a8c6f08c97945f131f38d3d044","ja":"これで今年の用事は全部終わったわね！\nお守りとおふだの返納の仕方、ふたりともわかった？","zh":"这样一来今年的事情就全部办完了呢！\n归还御守和神札的做法，你们两个都记住了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1693.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3f9041f9fd3911bd73f47a6ded3ad37066f33279d16e530574a63ed5e2b546f7","ja":"うん！\n来年はたまきもやってみるね！","zh":"嗯！\n明年环也要试试看！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1693.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1e1e78def7b67a3a73573aee928db226e41ac068933c4d95f02b4cd1b8fc2e45","ja":"お守りやおふだって、大みそかに\n「ありがとうございました」ってお返しするんだね。","zh":"御守和神札，要在除夕时\n说句“非常感谢”奉还回去呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1693.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5ace451e9a55234ae603bddbce0a255c5d719869b05cde5a6b60dfa829bb2c61","ja":"日付がはっきり決まってるわけじゃないけど、\n年末や年始に返納する人が多いみたいね。","zh":"虽然并没有明确规定具体的日期，\n但似乎很多人都会选择在年末或年初交还呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1693.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"9225117bd532b22c4977fd9979244a67ed4b42abb9f1e15d5684b274650b7482","ja":"今回は、近くでお仕事があったから寄ったんだけど、\n初詣の時に持っていく人も……。","zh":"这次是因为在附近有工作才顺便过来的，\n不过也有人在新年参拜时带过来……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1693.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"a78b729f949f3a5084ddab1d91deed9c6e17a41bcc6e42057d4fe3882877f013","ja":"あ！　初詣も劇場のみんなと行くの？　りつこ、\n今日はみんなと夜ふかしして、年越しするんでしょ？","zh":"啊！　新年参拜也是和剧场的大家一起去吗？律子，\n你今天会和大家一起熬夜跨年吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1693.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"3190606d981c80e7c011880a5c9b30dd3a0673fd35fa648e8445564dd23728e9","ja":"ええ。みんなで初日の出を見て、そのまま初詣に……\nえっ、どうして知ってるの！？","zh":"嗯。大家一起看了日出，然后顺道去新年参拜……\n诶，你怎么会知道的！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1693.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"a8ba546f849684c9f1fbcbd2f6229e4a1ff6d260e3b2b1299f01a580271f8166","ja":"他の人が言ってたよ？\n大学生以上の歳の人みんなで集まる、って。","zh":"其他人有说过哦？\n说是所有大学生年纪以上的人要聚在一起。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1693.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"782f31feb152b1a9005f819102efd06c9e5f0db85fac5ac19ff29d75b6ee8fd2","ja":"ずっとみんなでお話しできるんだよね？\nいいなぁ～。にぎやかで、すごく楽しそう。","zh":"可以一直和大家聊天对吧？\n真好啊～热热闹闹的，看起来好开心。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1693.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"b829250413adb460b240dea9f970972d4aafdd412dc4c7bc24e951aaa64e516c","ja":"たまきも、みんなと一緒に年越ししたいぞ！","zh":"环也想和大家一起跨年哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1693.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"e5f718d769ff5d078ebfc4acee0a45d57398de4ac93b73ec69a18aecd3ff9ffe","ja":"（そ、そんなに期待に満ちた目で言われたら……。\nでも、小学生に夜更かしさせるのも……）","zh":"（被、被用那么充满期待的眼神看着这么说的话……\n可是，让小学生熬夜也实在不太好……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1693.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"b1c9899c1337d74fb53d1314e95f9e66478ea1ab46cd03f36ac7a022ea79be94","ja":"……！　そうね、まずはご家族に連絡してみて。\n許可してもらえたら、私も参加を考えてあげるわ。","zh":"……！也是呢，你先试着联系一下家人吧。\n要是能得到许可，我也可以考虑参加哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1693.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"4c322c20c07c3971eeff43830525e4e10578639acc860826a571d483eacaa55f","ja":"ほんと！？　うん、すぐ電話するね♪","zh":"真的吗！？嗯，我马上打电话哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1693.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"216c445112ac7517c734abf97b15692858db508adf5872b13a9c6a1703ff7318","ja":"たまきも、お願いしてみる～！","zh":"环也要来许愿看看～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
